---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---

<Base title="Prashant Shah" bg="home">
  <section class="hero reveal">
    <p class="label">Software Engineer &middot; Researcher</p>
    <h1 transition:name="page-title">
      I build software that closes the gap between what systems know and what people need.
    </h1>
    <p class="proof">
      Three internships. Research published at SAM International. CS &amp; Data Science at Ramapo College, graduating May 2026.
    </p>

    <div class="ctas">
      <a href="/resume.pdf" class="btn-primary">Resume</a>
      <a href="mailto:shahp0021@gmail.com" class="btn-outline">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="work-panel glass reveal" style="animation-delay: 0.15s">
    <h2 class="section-label">Selected Work</h2>

    <a href="/work#canvas-agent" class="card">
      <div class="card-top">
        <h3>Canvas Agent</h3>
        <span class="year">2026</span>
      </div>
      <p>AI agent with generative UI that builds interface components at runtime from user intent. 9 typed tools, parameterized SQL, persistent memory. Won HackRamapo.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/work#trimble" class="card">
      <div class="card-top">
        <h3>Trimble</h3>
        <span class="year">2025</span>
      </div>
      <p>Production configuration management platform in C#/.NET and Azure for a distributed broker architecture serving enterprise transportation.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/research" class="card">
      <div class="card-top">
        <h3>Intent-Content Conflict in Retrieval</h3>
        <span class="year">ongoing</span>
      </div>
      <p>When user intent contradicts content semantics, retrieval breaks. Building a framework to resolve that conflict using knowledge graphs where emotions are first-class entities.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/work#pantry" class="card">
      <div class="card-top">
        <h3>Center for Food Action</h3>
        <span class="year">2025</span>
      </div>
      <p>Full-stack inventory platform replacing manual tracking across 6 pantries serving 40,000 people annually. Featured in News 12 NJ.</p>
    </a>

    <p class="currently">
      <strong>Currently:</strong> Finishing my capstone on collision risk prediction, extending the Canvas agent into a generative UI system, and looking for full-time roles starting Summer 2026.
      <a href="/now">What I'm up to &rarr;</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .hero {
    min-height: 65vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    padding-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    max-width: 580px;
    line-height: 1.1;
    text-shadow: 0 2px 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  .proof {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    max-width: 460px;
    margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .ctas {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    color: #09090f;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 150ms ease, transform 150ms ease;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-accent-hover);
    color: #09090f;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }

  .btn-outline {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    padding: 0.6rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: border-color 150ms ease, color 150ms ease;
  }

  .btn-outline:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-text);
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .work-panel {
    padding: 0.25rem 1.5rem 1rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-faint);
    padding: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .card {
    display: block;
    padding: 1.1rem 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 150ms ease;
  }

  .card:hover { opacity: 0.85; }

  .card:last-of-type { border-bottom: none; }

  .card-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .card h3 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text);
    transition: color 150ms ease;
  }

  .card:hover h3 { color: var(--color-accent); }

  .year {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    color: var(--color-faint);
  }

  .card p {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .currently {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    padding: 1rem 0 0.5rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .currently strong {
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-weight: 600;
  }
</style>
